# In local dev, leave VITE_API_URL unset - requests to /api/v1/* are proxied
# to the Laravel backend by vite.config.ts (see `server.proxy`).
#
# In production (e.g. Vercel), set this to the full URL of the deployed
# backend so the frontend calls it directly (cross-origin, allowed via CORS -
# see backend FRONTEND_URLS in backend/.env).
# VITE_API_URL=https://x-pressing-api.koyeb.app/api/v1
